WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:03.650 Full-Court is for the tennis person who wears more than one hat.
00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:11.420 Keep Player, Coach, Captain, League, and Tournament Desk tools connected to the same tennis identity and trusted data.
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.450 Move between roles without rebuilding the context you already created somewhere else.
